<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n70937" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νομαδ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for a herdsman's life, pastoral,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βίος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1256b1
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dicaearch.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				4.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. διασκευή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					8.29.7
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γένη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Scymn.
					81
				</span></i>
			; also of flying insects, <i>roving, wandering,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ βίος ν.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>PA</u>
					682b7
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				<i>like nomads,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					2.1.17
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. καὶ Σκυθικῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					11.8.7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as pr. n.,
				<i>Numidian,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱππεῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					1.19.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλεκτρυών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Nav.</u>
					23
				</span></i>
			.</div>
